OL,3,AMahmood to set out changes to
OL,4,Asettlement rules for legal migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood will
OL,7,Fannounce her final decision on changes
OL,8,Fto immigration rules on Monday.
OL,10,FMahmood proposed extending the wait for
OL,11,Fpermanent settlement from the current
OL,12,Ffive years to 10, with some lower-paid
OL,13,Fmigrants facing a 15-year wait, in
OL,14,Fresponse to a period of high net
OL,15,Fmigration.
OL,17,FBut she faced criticism for proposing
OL,18,Fto apply the changes to migrant workers
OL,19,Falready in the UK, with Housing
OL,20,FSecretary Angela Rayner saying this
OL,21,Fwould "change the goalposts".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
