OL,3,AMahmood to set out changes to
OL,4,Asettlement rules for legal migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands the proposals are
OL,7,Flikely to be revised for most of those
OL,8,Fcurrently working in social care. The
OL,9,FConservatives said Mahmood had
OL,10,F"capitulated control of immigration
OL,11,Fpolicy" to Rayner.
